At `timeoutMs`, send `SIGTERM`. If the child has still not closed `graceMs`
later (default 100), send `SIGKILL` and set `escalated: true`. `timedOut` is
true whenever the deadline was reached, whether or not the escalation was
needed. A child that finishes on its own clears both timers.

```ts
