Report constructors that grew, filtered by a noise floor: keep only entries
whose `bytesDelta` is at least `minBytes` (default 1_048_576) **and** whose
`ratio` is at least `minRatio` (default 1.05). Constructors present only in
`after` count as growth from zero. Sort by `bytesDelta` descending, tie-broken
by name.

```ts
diffSnapshots(
  [{ name: "Session", count: 10, selfSize: 1000 }],
  [{ name: "Session", count: 20_000, selfSize: 4_000_000 }],
  { minBytes: 1000, minRatio: 1.5 },
