From the root, repeatedly descend into the child with the largest **subtree**
hit count, stopping when the current node has no children or when no child's
subtree beats the node's own `hitCount`. Report the chain, the final subtree
hits and its share of the profile.

`verdict` is `"hot-spot"` when `share >= options.hotSpotShare` (default 0.3),
`"diffuse"` otherwise — the difference between "one function to fix" and
"death by a thousand cuts", which call for completely different responses.

```ts
